  "body": "[SSH File Transfer Protocol](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SSH_File_Transfer_Protocol) has been around for more than 2 decades with many clients out there supporting it (some [incomplete](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:SFTP_clients) [lists](https://www.sftp.net/clients)).\r\n\r\nthe html spec already allows for ssh:// & ftp://, so sftp:// seems pretty straight froward.\r\n\r\n[the IETF RFC that defines both ssh:// & sftp://](https://tools.ietf.org/html/draft-ietf-secsh-scp-sftp-ssh-uri-04#page-5).\r\n",
